      "standardized_narrative": "At 31 December 2018 the syndicate's opening gross claims outstanding (1 Jan 2018) was GBP 1,015.305m. Based on the gross claims development triangle the syndicate reports a small net prior-year release of approximately GBP 4.6m (c.0.45% of opening gross reserves), driven by favourable claims development notably in casualty and EL/PL lines and reserve releases from prior years. These releases were partially offset by current-year catastrophe losses (hurricanes, typhoons and Californian wildfires) which the report states were within modelled expectations. The syndicate also absorbed a reinsurance-to-close (Syndicate 2255) in January 2018 which is a one-off structural item noted in the report.",
